msgid "Upload an image or a video."
msgstr "Rasm yoki video yuklang."

msgid "Unsupported video format. Allowed: MP4, MOV, WEBM, M4V."
msgstr "Video formati qo'llab-quvvatlanmaydi. Ruxsat etilgan: MP4, MOV, WEBM, M4V."

msgid "The video is too large (maximum 100 MB)."
msgstr "Video hajmi juda katta (eng ko'pi 100 MB)."

msgid "The video is too long (maximum 120 seconds)."
msgstr "Video juda uzun (eng ko'pi 120 soniya)."

msgid "The video could not be processed. Upload a valid video file."
msgstr "Videoni qayta ishlab bo'lmadi. To'g'ri video fayl yuklang."

msgid "Video processing is not available: ffmpeg is not installed on the server."
msgstr "Videoni qayta ishlash mavjud emas: serverda ffmpeg o'rnatilmagan."

msgid "MP4/MOV/WEBM, up to 120 seconds, up to 100 MB. The poster is created automatically."
msgstr "MP4/MOV/WEBM, 120 soniyagacha, 100 MB gacha. Poster avtomatik yaratiladi."

msgid "Upload an image or a video. For a video the poster is created automatically; upload an image only to use your own poster."
msgstr "Rasm yoki video yuklang. Video uchun poster avtomatik yaratiladi; o'z posteringizni ishlatish uchun rasm yuklang."

msgid "Video"
msgstr "Video"

msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Ko'rinish"

msgid "We received your request"
msgstr "So'rovingiz qabul qilindi"

msgid "Hello, %(name)s!\n\nThank you for contacting MGA Reklama. Your request has been received and we will contact you soon.\n\nMGA Reklama"
msgstr "Assalomu alaykum, %(name)s!\n\nMGA Reklama'ga murojaat qilganingiz uchun rahmat. So'rovingiz qabul qilindi, tez orada siz bilan bog'lanamiz.\n\nMGA Reklama"

msgid "Enter a valid phone number."
msgstr "To'g'ri telefon raqam kiriting."

msgid "Upload an image or a video, or add a video link."
msgstr "Rasm yoki video yuklang, yoki video havolasini kiriting."

msgid "Enter a valid Instagram or YouTube link."
msgstr "To'g'ri Instagram yoki YouTube havolasini kiriting."

msgid "Enter a link to a specific Instagram post or reel (for example https://www.instagram.com/reel/XXXX/)."
msgstr "Instagram'dagi aniq post yoki reel havolasini kiriting (masalan, https://www.instagram.com/reel/XXXX/)."

msgid "Enter a link to a specific YouTube video."
msgstr "YouTube'dagi aniq video havolasini kiriting."

msgid "Only Instagram and YouTube links are allowed."
msgstr "Faqat Instagram va YouTube havolalariga ruxsat beriladi."

msgid "Video link"
msgstr "Video havola"

msgid "Instagram or YouTube link (for example https://www.instagram.com/reel/XXXX/). For Instagram also upload a poster image. If a video file is uploaded too, the file takes priority."
msgstr "Instagram yoki YouTube havolasi (masalan, https://www.instagram.com/reel/XXXX/). Instagram uchun posterni ham yuklang. Video fayl ham yuklansa, fayl ustun bo'ladi."

